{"seq":2,"slug":"visibility-problem","title":"可见性问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/foundations/visibility-problem","wordCount":1714,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"可见性问题\">可见性问题</h1><p>「能不能看见」在玩家嘴里是一句直觉，在代码里却必须是一个有明确输入输出的查询。把它说清楚之前，谁也写不出正确的视野算法——更糟的是，含混的可见性定义会埋下不对称视野这种隐蔽 bug：我能偷看你而你看不见我，玩家会骂这游戏「视野有问题」却说不出哪里。本篇把可见性从直觉提炼成一个精确的几何问题：定义观察者、目标、遮挡集合，列出一个良定义算法必须满足的性质，并辨明几种容易混淆的「可见」语义。这个定义是 <a href=\"../computation/\">视野计算</a> 整章所有算法要去求解的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可见性问题的最小形式是：给定观察点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>、目标点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、以及一组遮挡物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，判断从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的视线是否被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 中任何元素阻断。形式化地，设连接二者的线段为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{ot}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8151em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7351em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则可见当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{ot} \\cap B = \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8151em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7351em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>。从这个原子查询出发，可以向上构造两类更大的问题：<strong>点对点</strong>（A 能否看到 B，一次一对）和<strong>点对区域</strong>（从 A 出发能看到的全部格子，即视野/FOV）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[可见性问题] --&gt; B[输入]&#10;    A --&gt; C[输出]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[观察点 o&lt;br/&gt;位置与视野半径]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[目标 t&lt;br/&gt;点或整片区域]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[遮挡集合 B&lt;br/&gt;墙体/地形/高度]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[点对点&lt;br/&gt;布尔: 可见/不可见]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[点对区域&lt;br/&gt;可见格集合 FOV]&#10;    C1 --&gt; D[原子查询&lt;br/&gt;见 视线判定]&#10;    C2 --&gt; D2[聚合查询&lt;br/&gt;见 阴影投射]\">flowchart TD\n    A[可见性问题] --&gt; B[输入]\n    A --&gt; C[输出]\n    B --&gt; B1[观察点 o&lt;br/&gt;位置与视野半径]\n    B --&gt; B2[目标 t&lt;br/&gt;点或整片区域]\n    B --&gt; B3[遮挡集合 B&lt;br/&gt;墙体/地形/高度]\n    C --&gt; C1[点对点&lt;br/&gt;布尔: 可见/不可见]\n    C --&gt; C2[点对区域&lt;br/&gt;可见格集合 FOV]\n    C1 --&gt; D[原子查询&lt;br/&gt;见 视线判定]\n    C2 --&gt; D2[聚合查询&lt;br/&gt;见 阴影投射]</pre><p>下表把可见性问题的几个变体并列，它们共享同一个原子查询但聚合方式不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题变体</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>主力算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点对点视线</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o, t, B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>射线步进 / Bresenham</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单源视野（FOV）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>, 半径, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可见格集合</td>\n<td>递归阴影投射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多源可见性场</td>\n<td>多个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每格可见者计数</td>\n<td>预计算可见性场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向可见（谁能看到我）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>, 所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>观察者集合</td>\n<td>对称 FOV 或反查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"遮挡模型-墙在格子里还是在格子边\">遮挡模型：墙在格子里还是在格子边</h2><p>定义可见性，最微妙的地方是遮挡物到底「占据」什么。有两种主流约定，选错会让结果差一格。<strong>格子遮挡</strong>把不透明性赋给整个格子：这一格是墙，视线穿不过它的中心；优点是与网格数据天然对齐，roguelike 几乎都用它。<strong>边遮挡</strong>（薄墙）把不透明性赋给格子之间的边：墙是零厚度的，立在两格交界上；这能表达「贴着墙根能斜看过去」这种细腻情形，但算法要复杂得多，Red Blob Games 对薄墙视野有专门的处理。</p>\n<p>遮挡还可能是<strong>部分的</strong>：高草丛降低可见但不完全阻断、烟雾按距离衰减视线。这时可见性不再是布尔而是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的透光率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，沿视线累乘：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>透过率</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{透过率} = \\prod_i (1 - \\alpha_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">透过率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。一旦累计透过率低于阈值即判为不可见。是否需要部分遮挡，取决于游戏类型，<a href=\"fog-of-war-types\">战争迷雾类型</a> 的信息维度分类能帮你提前判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"良定义的六条性质\">良定义的六条性质</h2><p>一个可信赖的可见性算法应当满足若干性质，缺一条都会带来玩家能感知的怪异。社区（尤其 roguelike 圈）总结出六条理想性质：对称性、连续性、无盲点、无暗角扩散、有限视野形状合理、计算高效。其中<strong>对称性</strong>最关键也最常被违反：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 能看见 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则把观察者换到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 也必须能看见 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>。违反它会产生单向视野——一方能先手开火而对方毫无预警，在竞技游戏里这是致命不公。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>对称性</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>visible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>visible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{对称性}:\\quad \\text{visible}(o, t) \\iff \\text{visible}(t, o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对称性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">visible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">visible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>朴素的逐格射线投射几乎必然破坏对称性，因为「从 A 射向 B」与「从 B 射向 A」走的离散格子序列不同。这正是 <a href=\"../computation/shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 中「对称阴影投射」要专门解决的问题——它通过判定格子中心点的可见而非整格来恢复对称。</p>\n<h2 id=\"几种容易混淆的-可见\">几种容易混淆的「可见」</h2><p>日常说「看见」时，其实混着几种不同语义，代码里必须区分。<strong>几何可见</strong>：纯粹由遮挡决定，视线没被挡住。<strong>视野内可见</strong>：在几何可见的基础上还要在观察者的视野半径或视锥内——FPS 里你背后的敌人几何上可能无遮挡，但不在你视锥里，仍算看不见。<strong>信息可见</strong>：这是联机迷雾的关键——某单位是否被「告知」给某玩家，由服务器决定，可能严格小于几何可见（出于反作弊只发更少）。三者的关系是层层收窄的过滤。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[全部目标] --&gt; B[几何可见&lt;br/&gt;视线未被遮挡]&#10;    B --&gt; C[视野内可见&lt;br/&gt;在半径/视锥内]&#10;    C --&gt; D[信息可见&lt;br/&gt;服务器决定下发]&#10;    D --&gt; E[渲染可见&lt;br/&gt;实际画到屏幕]\">flowchart TD\n    A[全部目标] --&gt; B[几何可见&lt;br/&gt;视线未被遮挡]\n    B --&gt; C[视野内可见&lt;br/&gt;在半径/视锥内]\n    C --&gt; D[信息可见&lt;br/&gt;服务器决定下发]\n    D --&gt; E[渲染可见&lt;br/&gt;实际画到屏幕]</pre><p>混淆这几层会出 bug：把「几何可见」当「信息可见」直接下发，就等于把没看见的敌人坐标也发给了客户端，透视外挂立刻能读出来——这正是 <a href=\"../systems/fog-anti-cheat\">迷雾与反作弊</a> 要堵的洞。而把「信息可见」当「渲染可见」，又会出现「数据收到了却没画出来」的显示 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把问题降维-从连续到离散\">把问题降维：从连续到离散</h2><p>真实世界的可见性是连续几何问题，但游戏几乎总把它离散化以求可算。离散化引入两个误差源：<strong>位置量化</strong>（连续坐标落到格子中心，偏差最大半格）与<strong>视线采样</strong>（连续线段用有限格子序列近似，可能漏穿或多挡）。这两个误差正是不对称、暗角漏光等 bug 的根源。处理它们有两条路：要么精心设计离散算法使其保持关键性质（阴影投射走这条路），要么干脆保留连续查询、只在需要时算（视点式迷雾走这条路，依赖 <a href=\"../computation/line-of-sight\">视线判定</a>）。</p>\n<p>降维的程度也是性能旋钮：网格越细，可见性越精确但每帧扫描越贵；网格越粗，越便宜但越容易出现「明明该看见却被一整格墙挡住」的违和。<a href=\"../computation/grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 会讨论如何在分辨率与开销间预计算出平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可见性问题的原子形式是「线段是否与遮挡集合相交」，向上聚合出点对点与点对区域两类查询。</li>\n<li>遮挡模型有格子遮挡与薄墙之分，部分遮挡用透光率累乘表达，选择由游戏类型决定。</li>\n<li>对称性是六条理想性质中最关键的一条：违反它会产生单向视野这种竞技不公，朴素射线投射几乎必然违反。</li>\n<li>「可见」至少有几何、视野内、信息、渲染四层语义，层层收窄；混淆它们会导致透视外挂或显示 bug。</li>\n<li>离散化引入位置量化与视线采样两类误差，是不对称与漏光 bug 的根源，也是性能与精度的旋钮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"fog-of-war-types\">战争迷雾类型</a> 决定你要解哪种可见性变体；<a href=\"fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a> 把可见性结果落成状态。</li>\n<li>求解算法：<a href=\"../computation/line-of-sight\">视线判定</a> 解点对点，<a href=\"../computation/shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 解点对区域并恢复对称性。</li>\n<li>跨库：连续遮挡判定与 <a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/framing-control/collision-occlusion\">相机系统的碰撞与遮挡</a> 共用射线测试；信息可见的安全含义见 <a href=\"../../game-anti-cheat-security/foundations/trust-boundaries\">反作弊的信任边界</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可见性问题","id":"可见性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"遮挡模型：墙在格子里还是在格子边","id":"遮挡模型-墙在格子里还是在格子边"},{"level":2,"text":"良定义的六条性质","id":"良定义的六条性质"},{"level":2,"text":"几种容易混淆的「可见」","id":"几种容易混淆的-可见"},{"level":2,"text":"把问题降维：从连续到离散","id":"把问题降维-从连续到离散"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"战争迷雾类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/foundations/fog-of-war-types"},"next":{"title":"迷雾三态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/foundations/fog-state-model"}}